  "prefLabel": "En 2002.17 Investment grade credit rating",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "En 2002.17 “Investment grade credit rating” means a current rating for senior unsubordinated debt of AAA, AA, A, or BBB, as issued by S&P Global Ratings, or Aaa, Aa, A, or Baa, as issued by Moody’s Investors Service, Inc.\n\nSource. #14583, eff 5-15-26, EXPIRES: 5-15-36",
